    "Installing downloads it, checks that it is signed by the same developer as this copy, and relaunches Vitrine." : {
      "comment" : "Check for Updates alert text when an update is available",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
